{"RukuNumber":279,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":11,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَكَمۡ قَصَمۡنَا مِن قَرۡيَةٖ كَانَتۡ ظَالِمَةٗ وَأَنشَأۡنَا بَعۡدَهَا قَوۡمًا ءَاخَرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَكَمْ قَصَمْنَا مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َرْيَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةٍ ك</tajweed>َانَتْ ظَالِمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً و</tajweed>َأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َأْنَا بَعْدَهَا قَوْمًا ءَاخَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١١</span>","End":"١١","PageNumber":323,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":279,"MaqraNumber":129,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":12,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَمَّآ أَحَسُّواْ بَأۡسَنَآ إِذَا هُم مِّنۡهَا يَرۡكُضُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَحَسُّو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بَأْسَن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِذَا ه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهَا يَرْكُض<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٢</span>","End":"١٢","PageNumber":323,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":279,"MaqraNumber":129,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":13,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَا تَرۡكُضُواْ وَٱرۡجِعُوٓاْ إِلَىٰ مَآ أُتۡرِفۡتُمۡ فِيهِ وَمَسَٰكِنِكُمۡ لَعَلَّكُمۡ تُسۡـَٔلُونَ","TajweedText":"لَا تَرْكُضُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>رْجِع<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أُتْرِفْتُمْ فِيهِ وَمَسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِنِكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُسْــَٔل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٣</span>","End":"١٣","PageNumber":323,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilN